  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot Development of Performance-Based PPP Models for Water Infrastructure in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the development of pilot projects for performance-based and public-private partnership (PPP) approaches in water management infrastructure in Bangladesh. It focuses on identifying feasible project opportunities, assessing institutional and financial viability, and developing practical project concepts using lifecycle and output-based approaches.The project engages key stakeholders, including government agencies and multilateral development banks, to explore sustainable financing pathways and improve long-term infrastructure performance.</narrative>
  </description>
